/** \page cty_tree Country Data

\section description_16 Description

This view lists the database used in parsing calligns and is in
four parts.
- DXCC Entities ordered by DXCC identification number.
- DXCC Entities ordered by its traditional prefix (nickname).
- All prefixes with separate entities.
- Specific callsigns noted as exceptions to the decode.

\image html cty_tree_1.png "Country list (in main window)"
\image latex cty_tree_1.png "Country list (in main window)"

Entries in red are those which are no longer valid: either deleted 
from the DXCC list or expired.

*/